  "notes": "This file is the source of truth for runtime->model lists, read by SessionManager.get_models_for_runtime() / fetch_*_models() for every runtime (issue #359). Editing this file (add/remove/reorder model ids) takes effect on the next manifest read -- no code changes or restarts required. Schema: runtimes.<runtime> is a flat, ordered array of model id strings. Display group, label, and known short aliases (e.g. 'sonnet-4.6') are derived automatically from each id (see _model_group_from_id / _model_label_from_id / _model_aliases_from_id in agent_manager.py). Runtimes with live CLI/API discovery (copilot, opencode, devin, cursor, ollama, wee) still prefer that live data when available and fall back to this manifest, then to a small static list as a last resort if both the manifest and live discovery are unavailable. Runtime aliases: 'copilot-sdk' shares the 'copilot' entry."
